  "notes": "## 0.10.0-alpha.10 - 2026-05-17\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fixed Snap builds opening a localhost connection error instead of loading the app\n- Fixed Snap startup failures when the system keyring is unavailable, so the app can still start and keep its identity data in the app data directory until keyring access works\n- Corrected Snap installation guidance to use the alpha edge channel and include the keyring permission step\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.10.0-alpha.10 - 2026-05-17\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复 Snap 包启动后显示 localhost 连接错误、无法加载应用的问题\n- 修复 Snap 环境下系统钥匙串不可用时应用启动失败的问题，现在会先启动应用，并在钥匙串可用前把身份数据保存在应用数据目录中\n- 修正 Snap 安装说明，明确需要使用 alpha edge 通道并补充钥匙串授权步骤",
